        <mxCell id="flow" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#4A7CC7;fillColor=#F5F9FF;fontSize=14;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;" value="1  Verify hardware/firmware compatibility with ESX 9&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;2  Verify subscription entitlement (VVF/VCF 9)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;3  Ensure VCF Operations 9 is registered with Broadcom  4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;Upgrade/Verify vCenter Server 9&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;5&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Add edge hosts to vCenter 9&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;6  Verify licenses in vCenter via VCF Operations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;7  Backup host configuration &amp;amp; VMs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;8  Put host in Maintenance Mode&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;9  Perform in-place upgrade: ESXi 8 → ESX 9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;10 Verify host, networking, storage&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;11 Start VMs and validate workloads&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2 Repeat for next edge site&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
